      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOMMY TSUNAMI (1) did a good job to finish third last time out over 400m at this track (23.47) in a Mix 1/2/3, the second top-three finish on the trot. Safe beginner and drawn well on the inside. This looks easier and expected to bounce back. BLAZING WARRIOR (2) has an excellent record over this course and distance having never missed the placings in seven starts, including six wins. Comes off a (30.10) win last time, scoring by 2 lengths in a Grade 5 over 520m at Wentworth Park. Makes strong appeal on best. SMART COMET (4) boasts a consistent overall record including 33 wins from 99 starts, but missed the frame latest when fourth (23.04) over 400m at this track. Looks suited and expected to run well. POCKET POINT (8) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
